# The HUD's own models on the HUD panel (LIST-0.1.1 item 9; Vixel: "jak 1 hud might be unreadable"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_HUD=1 (the HUD kept on screen). Start as jak1_hud_stays.sim; in play, a picture ahead and one looking
# down. Each -panel.png has the power cell, orb and fly icons beside their counts; the eyes have none of them. The log:
# "[vr-view] the HUD's models in bucket N: drawn on the HUD".
2400 menu 1
2406 menu 0
2700 a 1
2706 a 0
3000 a 1
3006 a 0
3420 y 1
3426 y 0
4200 shot hud1-ahead
4210 head_pitch -30
4260 shot hud1-down
4270 head_pitch 0
4330 quit 0
